Service Level Agreement (SLA)
Vendor: Fresh Foods Inc.

1. Delivery Requirements
   - Maximum delivery time: 24 hours from order placement
   - Delivery window: 06:00 to 22:00 daily
   - Temperature requirements: 2°C to 8°C for cold chain items
   - Quality score requirement: Minimum 85%

2. Performance Standards
   - On-time delivery rate: 95% minimum
   - Temperature compliance: 98% minimum
   - Product quality compliance: 90% minimum
   - Documentation accuracy: 100%

3. Monitoring and Reporting
   - Real-time temperature monitoring required
   - Daily delivery performance reports
   - Weekly quality assurance audits
   - Monthly compliance reviews

4. Breach Conditions
   - Temperature deviation beyond ±1°C
   - Delivery delays exceeding 30 minutes
   - Quality scores below 80%
   - Missing or incomplete documentation

5. Penalties
   - First violation: Written warning
   - Second violation: 5% invoice deduction
   - Third violation: 10% invoice deduction
   - Contract termination after 5 major violations

6. Quality Assurance
   - HACCP certification required
   - Regular staff training
   - Clean transport vehicles
   - Proper handling procedures

7. Documentation Requirements
   - Temperature logs
   - Delivery receipts
   - Quality inspection reports
   - Staff certifications

8. Emergency Procedures
   - 24/7 contact availability
   - Backup delivery arrangements
   - Incident reporting within 1 hour
   - Corrective action within 4 hours 